---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Calcio Inglese — independent English-language Premier League news and analysis."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>About Calcio Inglese</h1>
    <p>Calcio Inglese is an independent news publication covering the Premier League — transfers, match reports and analysis, published daily in English.</p>
    <p>We follow every club in the English top flight, tracking transfer business, team news and the storylines that matter across the season.</p>
    <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
    <p>Our reporting draws on publicly reported facts from established football media and is written independently in our own words. We do not republish or reproduce articles from other outlets.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { padding: 30px 0 60px; max-width: 680px; }
  h1 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  h2 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; margin: 26px 0 12px; }
  p { margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink); }
</style>
